{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12110260","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1211026001:1":{"text":"マスター、あれは魔像！？この無人島にも魔像がいるなんて！","source_cn":"主人……有魔偶！魔偶出现在无人岛了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E66380EF84CC55A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、あれは魔像！？この無人島にも魔像がいるなんて！","female":"マスター、あれは魔像！？この無人島にも魔像がいるなんて！","variant_male_record_index":"130980","variant_female_record_index":"130981","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211026002:1":{"text":"おっきなおもちゃだ！","source_cn":"是大玩具！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062B8793537E50B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211026003:1":{"text":"魔像はとても危険な戦闘機械なんです。あまり近づかないでくださいね。","source_cn":"这是很危险的战争机器，最好保持距离。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91CF26EC6215533D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211026004:1":{"text":"それにしても、遺跡山脈でもこんなに大量の魔像は見たことがありません。","source_cn":"不过话说回来，这里的魔偶简直比遗迹群山还要多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA438AE931EF9C7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211026005:1":{"text":"浪と漂流の神様は、ロンロンたちに魔像を倒してほしいのでしょうか？","source_cn":"风浪与漂泊之神是希望我们打败这些魔偶吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB339CF4BC613003C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_